hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"179","It is Muhammad ibn Abd al-Ala al-San’ani, it is Khalid, meaning Ibn al-Harith, it is Shu’bah, al-Ash’ath said, who is Ibn Sulaym, he said: I heard my father, He narrates, on the authority of Masruq, on the authority of Aisha, may God be pleased with her, that the Messenger of God, may God’s prayers and peace be upon him, “loved semen as long as he was able to purify it.” “And his shoes and his feet.” Shu’bah said: Then I heard Al-Ash’ath Wasit, saying: “The young man loves to mention all of his affairs.” He said: Then I heard him In Kufa, he says: “The Tyman loves as much as he can.”"
